    {'pass': 'AV-Human', 'sample_id': '155', 'task_type': 'Audio Character Matching', 'task_code': 'AVCM', 'transcript': "it's time to admit that the Playbook that guided businesses and CEOs for the last four years is broken the CEO Playbook says about shareholders and there's so much is sacrificed for it it's factories communities jobs but yet the CEOs pay up goes up and up and up and up and so many people are left behind I'm here to tell you no more the new Antioch Playbook is about Community if you are right with your people you will be more innovative you will have more passionate people working for you and the community that supports you and that's what the anti sea of Playbook is all about this is the difference between profit and true wealth"},
